{"id":"cryptdisks_stop.8","n":"cryptdisks_stop","s":"8","src":{"u":{"pkg":"cryptsetup","ver":"2:2.4.3-1ubuntu1.3","repo":"jammy-updates/main","url":"http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/pool/main/c/cryptsetup/cryptsetup_2.4.3-1ubuntu1.3_amd64.deb","path":"/usr/share/man/man8/cryptdisks_stop.8.gz","sha256":"c0d09b0104df521a8949d4ae3e26e0e65917eb76f596d3372f58120fb80f6d9a","date":"2024-11-14","origin":"cryptsetup 2:2.4.3-1ubunt"}},"nopt":{"u":0},"desc":"wrapper around cryptsetup that parses /etc/crypttab.","u":[["NAME","<p>cryptdisks_stop - wrapper around cryptsetup that parses /etc/crypttab.</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<p><b>cryptdisks_stop</b> <i>&lt;name&gt;</i></p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p><b>cryptdisks_stop</b> is a wrapper around <b>cryptsetup</b> that parses <b>/etc/crypttab</b> just like the initscript /etc/init.d/cryptdisks does and stops the dm-crypt mapping that corresponds to <i>&lt;name&gt;</i>.</p>"],["SEE ALSO","<p><i>cryptdisks_start</i>(8), <i>cryptsetup</i>(8), <i>crypttab</i>(5)</p>"],["AUTHOR","<p>This manual page was written by Jonas Meurer &lt;mejo@debian.org&gt; in January 2008.</p>"]]}